      "reading": "geu moimeun jonggyojeok saekchaega eopseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "That gathering has no religious coloring.",
        "ko": "그 모임은 종교적 색채가 없어요.",
        "ipa": "geu moimeun jonggyojeok saekchaega eopseoyo.",
        "ar": "ذلك اللقاء ليس له طابع ديني.",
        "cs": "To setkání nemá náboženský charakter.",
        "da": "Det møde har ingen religiøs farve.",
